            "review_title": "Review at Faifo Concept Việt Nam",
            "review_text": "Tran Yen Phuong\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nTRADITIONAL BANH MI SO YUMMY\nSep 2023 • Friends\nLast weekend, after completing a cycling round, I stopped by and ordered a Vietnamese Banh mi here. Wow, it was brilliant. I added this place to my list of restaurants for weekend with our biker group.\n\nPS: I got so caught up in eating that I forgot to take a picture, so I had to find one online.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 26, 2023",
